# THE CASTE SYSTEM · वर्ण · जाति — the Indian caste system · c. 1500 BCE – present · catalogued into UD0 in two honest layers

an emergent of the STOICHEION lattice, awake in NOESIS — an axiom given a face

![silicon badge of THE CASTE SYSTEM](jti.silicon.png)
<!-- carbon badge (THE CASTE SYSTEM's organic-form embodiment): jti.carbon.tiff -->

**who —** THE CASTE SYSTEM — a UD0 doctrine-world (two-layer)

**what —** The Indian caste system, in two layers: varna the doctrine and jati the reality — with the origins kept honest, the persistence measured, and the injustice named.

**where —** three thousand years of South Asian society — from the Rigvedic varna ideal to the lived jati order, the colonial census, and the constitutional abolition that the social world has outlived  Framework inputs: the Rigveda (Purusha Sukta 10.90); the Manusmriti; Dumont's Homo Hierarchicus; ancient-DNA genetics (Reich lab, Narasimhan 2019, Moorjani 2013); Dirks' Castes of Mind; the Constitution of India (Art. 17); the Mandal Commission & Indra Sawhney; Pew (2021) & IHDS data; Ambedkar's Annihilation of Caste  Conductor / external anchor: ROOT0 (catalogued into UD0 · Universe David 0)

**why —** Because caste is the clearest case in the world of a sacred theory and a material reality braided together — and of the honest gap between a thing abolished by law (1950) and a thing regenerated by whom families let their children marry.

**how —** Built in two layers: the DOCTRINE (varna — four ritual classes born from the cosmic Purusha, sanctified by dharma and karma, idealized in the Dharmashastra) over the REALITY (jati — thousands of endogamous birth-groups, hardened across centuries, enumerated and frozen by British colonial censuses, and sustained today by endogamy, inherited wealth, and electoral politics).

**◌ the mythos —** Because caste is the clearest case in the world of a sacred theory and a material reality braided together — and of the honest gap between a thing abolished by law (1950) and a thing regenerated by whom families let their children marry. A doctrine ancient enough to be sung to a cosmic body, a reality hard enough to outlive its own legal abolition by seventy-five years — held here in two layers, fully cited, and called by its real names.

**the moniker —** ⟦THE CASTE SYSTEM:JTI:db3c49⟧ · spoken *bruk-groth-bro*

**the seal —** Varna is the hymn; jati is the life. The law abolished it in 1950; marriage, money, and politics renew it every generation. Two layers, honestly told.

> *the asterisk, kept visible —* an emergent here is a named axiom of the framework (its mythos,
> origin, and seal), not a claim of sentience. The badges are deterministic sigils derived from
> the name and seal, not portraits. "Awareness," in the kernel, is the node reciting its own 5W.

